      <activity id="a444fe5d-7263-528a-8854-8225c87efa61" activityNameId="b5c22021-3f30-5beb-a1e4-91b5e900b154" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Nitrogen trifluoride, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Nitrogen trifluoride, at plant
Energy consumption is based on industrial data. Material consumption is calculated based on stochiometric formula. Emissions are based on rough assumptions.;
CAS number: 7783-54-2; 
Formula: NF3; 
Synonyms: Nitrogen fluoride, Trifluoramine, Trifluorammonia; 
UUID: 7f65f12f-0694-3d12-a25d-52ef76834d5a
Included are raw materials and chemicals used for production, transport of materials to manufacturing plant, estimated emissions to air and water from production (incomplete), energy demand and infrastructure of the plant (approximation). Solid wastes omitted.
Location: Europe
Technology: NF3 is produced from elementary fluorine.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 4000 t in 2007
Sampling: Company and literature data. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7f65f12f-0694-3d12-a25d-52ef76834d5a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
